/src-tauri/gen

# ── Secrets & signing material — never commit ─────────────────────────────────
# Android signing: the real keystore.properties (with the store password) and
# any keystore files stay local. keystore.properties.example IS committed.
keystore.properties
*.jks
*.keystore
# Apple signing / App Store Connect
*.p8
*.p12
*.mobileprovision
*.provisionprofile
*.cer
*.certSigningRequest
# Environment files
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Local Apple signing configs — contain cert SHA-1 identities and local
# provisioning-profile paths. Copy the .example files, fill in your own, and
# keep the real ones untracked. The .example templates ARE committed.
/src-tauri/tauri.prod-macos.conf.json
/src-tauri/tauri.prod-macos-appstore.conf.json
